{"title":"TCP congestion control, round trip by round trip","sub":"TCP Reno's congestion window on a path that can carry about 60 segments per round trip.","kind":"plot","interval":2300,"plot":{"xmin":0,"xmax":109,"ymin":0,"ymax":74,"ticks":[0,20,40,60,80],"xlabel":"round trips","h":240,"yticks":[[60,"capacity"]]},"legend":[["a","congestion window"],["bad","packet loss"],["c","timeout"]],"frames":[{"caption":"A new connection starts with a congestion window (cwnd) of 10 segments: how much TCP may have in flight before it must wait for acknowledgements. The dashed line is what the path can actually carry, which TCP doesn't know.","curves":[{"tok":"muted","pts":[[0,60],[109,60]],"dash":true,"w":1.5},{"tok":"a","pts":[[0,10]],"w":2.5}],"points":[{"x":0,"y":10,"tok":"b","r":6}],"stats":[["Round trip",1],["cwnd","10 segments"]]},{"caption":"<b>Slow start</b>: the window doubles every round trip (10 → 20 → 40 → 64). Not slow at all: exponential. It overshoots the path's capacity, a router queue overflows, and a packet is dropped (red).","curves":[{"tok":"muted","pts":[[0,60],[109,60]],"dash":true,"w":1.5},{"tok":"a","pts":[[0,10],[1,20],[2,40],[3,64]],"w":2.5}],"points":[{"x":3,"y":64,"tok":"bad","r":6},{"x":3,"y":64,"tok":"b","r":6}],"stats":[["Round trip",4],["cwnd","64 segments"]]},{"caption":"TCP halves the window to 32 and remembers that as its threshold. From now on it is in <b>congestion avoidance</b>.","curves":[{"tok":"muted","pts":[[0,60],[109,60]],"dash":true,"w":1.5},{"tok":"a","pts":[[0,10],[1,20],[2,40],[3,64],[4,32]],"w":2.5}],"points":[{"x":3,"y":64,"tok":"bad","r":6},{"x":4,"y":32,"tok":"b","r":6}],"stats":[["Round trip",5],["cwnd","32 segments"]]},{"caption":"Congestion avoidance grows the window by just one segment per round trip, carefully probing for spare capacity.","curves":[{"tok":"muted","pts":[[0,60],[109,60]],"dash":true,"w":1.5},{"tok":"a","pts":[[0,10],[1,20],[2,40],[3,64],[4,32],[5,33],[6,34],[7,35],[8,36],[9,37],[10,38],[11,39],[12,40],[13,41],[14,42],[15,43],[16,44],[17,45],[18,46],[19,47],[20,48],[21,49],[22,50],[23,51],[24,52],[25,53],[26,54],[27,55],[28,56],[29,57],[30,58],[31,59],[32,60]],"w":2.5}],"points":[{"x":3,"y":64,"tok":"bad","r":6},{"x":32,"y":60,"tok":"b","r":6}],"stats":[["Round trip",33],["cwnd","60 segments"]]},{"caption":"Over capacity again: loss, halve, repeat. <b>Additive increase, multiplicative decrease</b> (AIMD) gives TCP its signature sawtooth just under capacity, and it is also what makes competing flows converge to a fair share.","curves":[{"tok":"muted","pts":[[0,60],[109,60]],"dash":true,"w":1.5},{"tok":"a","pts":[[0,10],[1,20],[2,40],[3,64],[4,32],[5,33],[6,34],[7,35],[8,36],[9,37],[10,38],[11,39],[12,40],[13,41],[14,42],[15,43],[16,44],[17,45],[18,46],[19,47],[20,48],[21,49],[22,50],[23,51],[24,52],[25,53],[26,54],[27,55],[28,56],[29,57],[30,58],[31,59],[32,60],[33,61],[34,30]],"w":2.5}],"points":[{"x":3,"y":64,"tok":"bad","r":6},{"x":33,"y":61,"tok":"bad","r":6},{"x":34,"y":30,"tok":"b","r":6}],"stats":[["Round trip",35],["cwnd","30 segments"]]},{"caption":"A worse loss: no ACKs come back at all and the retransmission timer fires (aqua). TCP assumes the worst, drops cwnd to 1 and slow-starts again.","curves":[{"tok":"muted","pts":[[0,60],[109,60]],"dash":true,"w":1.5},{"tok":"a","pts":[[0,10],[1,20],[2,40],[3,64],[4,32],[5,33],[6,34],[7,35],[8,36],[9,37],[10,38],[11,39],[12,40],[13,41],[14,42],[15,43],[16,44],[17,45],[18,46],[19,47],[20,48],[21,49],[22,50],[23,51],[24,52],[25,53],[26,54],[27,55],[28,56],[29,57],[30,58],[31,59],[32,60],[33,61],[34,30],[35,31],[36,32],[37,33],[38,34],[39,35],[40,36],[41,37],[42,38],[43,39],[44,40],[45,41],[46,42],[47,43],[48,44],[49,45],[50,46],[51,47],[52,48],[53,49],[54,50],[55,51],[56,52],[57,53],[58,54],[59,55],[60,56],[61,57],[62,58],[63,59],[64,60],[65,61],[66,30],[67,31],[68,32],[69,33],[70,34],[71,35],[72,36],[73,37],[74,38],[75,39],[76,40],[77,41],[78,42],[79,43],[80,44],[81,45],[82,46],[83,47],[84,48],[85,49],[86,1]],"w":2.5}],"points":[{"x":3,"y":64,"tok":"bad","r":6},{"x":33,"y":61,"tok":"bad","r":6},{"x":65,"y":61,"tok":"bad","r":6},{"x":85,"y":49,"tok":"c","r":6},{"x":86,"y":1,"tok":"b","r":6}],"stats":[["Round trip",87],["cwnd","1 segment"]]},{"caption":"It doubles back up to half the old window, then resumes the sawtooth. Every new connection pays this ramp-up, which is why short HTTP/1.1 requests rarely reached full speed.","curves":[{"tok":"muted","pts":[[0,60],[109,60]],"dash":true,"w":1.5},{"tok":"a","pts":[[0,10],[1,20],[2,40],[3,64],[4,32],[5,33],[6,34],[7,35],[8,36],[9,37],[10,38],[11,39],[12,40],[13,41],[14,42],[15,43],[16,44],[17,45],[18,46],[19,47],[20,48],[21,49],[22,50],[23,51],[24,52],[25,53],[26,54],[27,55],[28,56],[29,57],[30,58],[31,59],[32,60],[33,61],[34,30],[35,31],[36,32],[37,33],[38,34],[39,35],[40,36],[41,37],[42,38],[43,39],[44,40],[45,41],[46,42],[47,43],[48,44],[49,45],[50,46],[51,47],[52,48],[53,49],[54,50],[55,51],[56,52],[57,53],[58,54],[59,55],[60,56],[61,57],[62,58],[63,59],[64,60],[65,61],[66,30],[67,31],[68,32],[69,33],[70,34],[71,35],[72,36],[73,37],[74,38],[75,39],[76,40],[77,41],[78,42],[79,43],[80,44],[81,45],[82,46],[83,47],[84,48],[85,49],[86,1],[87,2],[88,4],[89,8],[90,16],[91,24],[92,25],[93,26],[94,27],[95,28],[96,29],[97,30],[98,31],[99,32],[100,33],[101,34],[102,35],[103,36],[104,37],[105,38],[106,39],[107,40],[108,41],[109,42]],"w":2.5}],"points":[{"x":3,"y":64,"tok":"bad","r":6},{"x":33,"y":61,"tok":"bad","r":6},{"x":65,"y":61,"tok":"bad","r":6},{"x":85,"y":49,"tok":"c","r":6},{"x":109,"y":42,"tok":"b","r":6}],"stats":[["Round trip",110],["cwnd","42 segments"]]}]}